---
{
  title: "rejectedp"
}
---
### NAME

    rejectedp() - Determine whether a promise has settled with a rejection
    reason. A cancelled promise is not one of these — see cancelledp().

### SYNOPSIS

    int rejectedp( promise p );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine whether a promise has settled with a rejection reason. A
    cancelled promise is not one of these — see cancelledp().

### PARAMETERS

    p  (promise)
       The promise to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the promise has rejected, 0 if it is still pending, has
    resolved, or was cancelled.
